# Auto commit and push

When a change set for this arcade project is finished (frontend and/or `ramseys-arcade-api`):

1. Commit the relevant repos with a clear message (only when there are real changes).
2. Push to the tracked remote branch so Vercel (frontend) and Render (API) deploy.
3. Do this without waiting to be asked, unless the user says not to push for that change.

Do not force-push. Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials).
